# AmL Diagnostic is a store app

AmL Diagnostic is on the **AmL One official shelf**. Desktop OTA lives at
`https://aml.one/diagnostic-ota/`. There is no Android APK; GET on the phone
shows the listing without an install. Windows, Linux, and macOS GET the
zip / `.deb` / DMG.

```
✅ OFFICIAL_LISTINGS / catalog.ts row `diagnostic`
✅ Store icon `diagnostic.png` and app-info copy
✅ Frankfurt OTA (`/diagnostic-ota/`) when they ask to publish
❌ POST /api/publish/android (there is no Diagnostic APK)
❌ Listing Icon Tool
```

`publish` / `build the app` / **put it on the store** is OTA + AmL One deploy
+ `graphify update .` + GitHub. See `publish-workflow.mdc`.
